  "bio": "Samuel Finch, hailing from Bromsgrove in the United Kingdom, is renowned for his expertise in the intricate dotwork tattoo style. He operates out of Modern Electric Tattoo and is well-respected in the industry for maintaining an exceptional level of cleanliness at his studio, ensuring a safe and hygienic experience for all his clients. To book an appointment with Samuel, direct messages can be sent to his professional Instagram account 'ndysaf'.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Bromsgrove, England, United Kingdom"
